
:SPECIAL_TASK
"gives $obj_np(NP) to $rec_np(NP)"  /pres give $obj_np(NP) $rec_np(NP)     .
"gave $obj_np(NP) to $rec_np(NP)"   /past give $obj_np(NP) $rec_np(NP)     .

:TRANS_TASK
"is getting acquainted with"    /pres get_acquainted_with         .
"was getting acquainted with"   /past get_acquainted_with         .
"maintains that"                /pres maintain                  .
"maintained that"               /past maintain                  .
"goes to"                       /pres go_entity                 .
"went to"                       /past go_entity                 .
"wants to know"                 /pres seek_answers               .
"wanted to know"                /past seek_answers               .
"gets"                          /pres get                       .
"got"                           /past get                       .

:INTRANS_TASK
"prepares to enter the game"                        /pres startup               .
"prepared to enter the game"                        /past startup               .
